  "colorspace": {
    "note": "Material colours are authored in sRGB in both games (non-HDR properties copy numerically). SR1 is Gamma, SR2 is Linear+HDRP: HDR colour properties (hdr_color_props) are stored as raw linear values in a Linear project but as display values in a Gamma project, so they are converted with the sRGB transfer function in the SR2->SR1 direction and its inverse in SR1->SR2. Textures are copied bit-exact; only normal-map channel layout is converted."
  },
